<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n7318" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cĕlēs</span></b> ,
		ētis, m., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κέλης</span>. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>A racer</i>, <i>race-horse</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 34, 5,
				10, § 19</span></i>; v. <i><span class="en">Serv. ad
				Verg. A. 8, 635</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>A swift-sailing vessel</i>, <i>a
			yacht</i>, pure Lat. celox, <i><span class="en">Plin. 7, 56,
				57, § 208</span></i>; cf. <i><span class="en">Gell. 10,
				25, 5</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
